{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1586460322999256831,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring Operations and Advanced Features",
      "source_hash": 977557238803975904,
      "context_hash": 15183376370711607268,
      "translation": "io_uring 연산과 고급 기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "From basic read/write to SQPOLL and linked requests",
      "source_hash": 5677220730379552004,
      "context_hash": 7098993651949386956,
      "translation": "기본 read/write부터 SQPOLL과 연결된 요청까지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQPOLL": "SQPOLL"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported operations",
      "source_hash": 15043375182423652738,
      "context_hash": 1627528914039956322,
      "translation": "지원되는 연산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring supports a wide range of operations, all async:",
      "source_hash": 3522475378894724484,
      "context_hash": 15674468097842833972,
      "translation": "io_uring은 폭넓은 연산을 지원하며, 모두 비동기로 동작합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "File and socket I/O",
      "source_hash": 15640369959782564427,
      "context_hash": 5894761446141723406,
      "translation": "파일 및 소켓 I/O",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "liburing: the convenience wrapper",
      "source_hash": 3019080537947234899,
      "context_hash": 6747074962913475558,
      "translation": "liburing: 편의 래퍼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Most applications use `liburing` instead of raw syscalls:",
      "source_hash": 14961003314490369705,
      "context_hash": 13451426192365238889,
      "translation": "대부분의 애플리케이션은 원시 시스템 콜 대신 `liburing`을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscalls": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Batch example: submit multiple reads",
      "source_hash": 6612450075828109342,
      "context_hash": 3723323642456847395,
      "translation": "일괄 처리 예제: 여러 read 제출",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SQPOLL: eliminating syscalls entirely",
      "source_hash": 5972963703129405272,
      "context_hash": 16572622319147045925,
      "translation": "SQPOLL: 시스템 콜 완전 제거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQPOLL": "SQPOLL",
        "syscalls": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "With `IORING_SETUP_SQPOLL`, a dedicated kernel thread polls the SQ ring continuously.",
      "source_hash": 16183169068535290288,
      "context_hash": 5903237192278915835,
      "translation": "`IORING_SETUP_SQPOLL`을 사용하면 전용 커널 스레드가 SQ 링을 지속적으로 폴링합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel thread": "커널 스레드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Userspace never needs to call `io_uring_enter` — it just writes SQEs and they're picked up automatically:",
      "source_hash": 925478655720294430,
      "context_hash": 15474642595844530241,
      "translation": "사용자 공간은 `io_uring_enter`를 호출할 필요가 전혀 없으며, SQE를 기록하기만 하면 자동으로 처리됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQEs": "SQE",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel SQPOLL thread is pinned to a CPU (`sq_thread_cpu`) and runs at normal scheduling priority (`SCHED_NORMAL`).",
      "source_hash": 10636023421284378880,
      "context_hash": 17136992712388759893,
      "translation": "커널 SQPOLL 스레드는 하나의 CPU(`sq_thread_cpu`)에 고정되며 일반 스케줄링 우선순위(`SCHED_NORMAL`)로 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "SQPOLL": "SQPOLL",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "For ultra-low latency I/O, it avoids the ~1µs overhead of a syscall.",
      "source_hash": 16453347759460480880,
      "context_hash": 2322353056907319189,
      "translation": "초저지연 시간 I/O를 위해 시스템 콜의 약 1µs 오버헤드를 피합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:34:33.915522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fixed files (registered file descriptors)",
      "source_hash": 13844521516960206985,
      "context_hash": 15903200511214990695,
      "translation": "고정 파일(등록된 파일 디스크립터)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Fixed files": "고정 파일",
        "file descriptors": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Registering file descriptors eliminates per-operation fd lookups:",
      "source_hash": 3815141786029242043,
      "context_hash": 6879292724982057764,
      "translation": "파일 디스크립터를 등록하면 연산마다 수행하던 fd 조회가 사라집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptors": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Fixed files avoid taking a reference to the `struct file` on every operation — significant for high-IOPS workloads.",
      "source_hash": 5903245377341030270,
      "context_hash": 6023023214144741868,
      "translation": "고정 파일을 사용하면 연산마다 `struct file`에 대한 참조를 획득하지 않아도 되며, 이는 IOPS가 높은 워크로드에서 상당한 차이를 만듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Fixed files": "고정 파일",
        "IOPS": "IOPS",
        "workloads": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fixed buffers (registered buffers)",
      "source_hash": 11943081956376296392,
      "context_hash": 15825407727145954364,
      "translation": "고정 버퍼(등록된 버퍼)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fixed buffers": "고정 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Pre-registered buffers avoid per-I/O pinning of pages:",
      "source_hash": 648824646044234663,
      "context_hash": 3523598661980396835,
      "translation": "미리 등록한 버퍼를 사용하면 I/O마다 페이지를 고정(pinning)하지 않아도 됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Fixed buffers are pinned in memory once at registration.",
      "source_hash": 3255001466529880926,
      "context_hash": 17327411211382902320,
      "translation": "고정 버퍼는 등록 시점에 한 번만 메모리에 고정됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fixed buffers": "고정 버퍼",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Per-I/O page pinning/unpinning (which requires page table walks) is eliminated.",
      "source_hash": 15590527893986732251,
      "context_hash": 6329726292439533283,
      "translation": "I/O마다 수행하던 페이지 고정/해제(페이지 테이블 탐색이 필요함)가 사라집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "page table": "페이지 테이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linked requests",
      "source_hash": 987469534952256579,
      "context_hash": 15938704421809906433,
      "translation": "연결된 요청",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Chain SQEs so that the next one only starts when the previous completes successfully:",
      "source_hash": 4985765788056605369,
      "context_hash": 1005214557944151145,
      "translation": "이전 SQE가 성공적으로 완료되었을 때만 다음 SQE가 시작되도록 SQE를 체인으로 연결합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQEs": "SQE"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For hard chains that ignore errors, use `IOSQE_IO_HARDLINK` instead.",
      "source_hash": 6146022974353994633,
      "context_hash": 14622075221199667934,
      "translation": "오류를 무시하는 하드 체인이 필요하면 대신 `IOSQE_IO_HARDLINK`를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Buffer selection: provided buffers",
      "source_hash": 2307103184819926500,
      "context_hash": 853043846842025762,
      "translation": "버퍼 선택: 제공 버퍼(provided buffers)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of pre-assigning buffers to SQEs, let the kernel pick from a pool (useful when you don't know how many bytes will arrive):",
      "source_hash": 10918192574132728148,
      "context_hash": 14084371866971784684,
      "translation": "SQE에 버퍼를 미리 할당하는 대신 커널이 풀에서 버퍼를 고르도록 합니다(도착할 바이트 수를 알 수 없을 때 유용합니다):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQEs": "SQE",
        "bytes": "바이트",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Multishot operations",
      "source_hash": 350869511258411162,
      "context_hash": 4838112476209291475,
      "translation": "멀티샷 연산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "multishot": "멀티샷"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Some operations can post multiple CQEs from a single SQE:",
      "source_hash": 13975258426397406009,
      "context_hash": 13383536302328864838,
      "translation": "일부 연산은 하나의 SQE로 여러 개의 CQE를 게시할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CQEs": "CQE",
        "SQE": "SQE"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:50.091670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring and BPF",
      "source_hash": 1114198223042261835,
      "context_hash": 8316795328384869114,
      "translation": "io_uring과 BPF",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
